<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">SERIALIZED ASSET TRACKING</p><h1>Import equipment into the shop</h1><p class="text-secondary">Import complete lighting or sound catalog CSVs, or add serialized assets to an existing item type.</p></div></div>
<section class="card floating-card" data-card-key="inventory-import"><h2 class="floating-label"><span class="material-symbols-rounded" aria-hidden="true">upload_file</span>Import inventory</h2><div class="card-body"><form action="/inventory/import" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" data-ajax-form><?= csrf() ?>
<label class="form-label">Import type<select class="form-select mb-3" name="import_mode" data-import-mode><option value="catalog">Equipment catalog CSV</option><option value="serialized">Serialized asset list</option></select></label>
<div data-catalog-help><p class="text-secondary">Lighting CSV: <code>category,name,shop_quantity,unit,default_note,description</code>. Sound CSV: <code>category,category,name,sku,shop_quantity,unit,default_note,description</code>. Categories and item types are created automatically; each shop quantity creates a uniquely tagged serialized asset. Existing catalog items are updated safely, stock is never deleted, duplicate imports are blocked, and repeated identical rows are combined.</p></div>
<div data-serialized-fields hidden>
